{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791815940, "covers_from": "2026-10-12T14:39:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-12T14:40:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791816000, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-12T14:39:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 9725, "sprite_key": "turtle_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "長照", "content": "我有看到市府提出銀髮族的肌力課程，但實際詢問健康服務中心卻得不到任何回覆，覺得目前的市府沒有效率。", "display_name": "北投代表 No.9,725", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-12T14:39:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 43446, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "環境", "content": "可以不要再砍樹了嗎？我從小看到大的老榕樹就這樣沒了", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.43,446", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-12T14:39:23+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 16572, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "交通", "content": "公車猛踩剎車油門或衝很快，真的很折磨搭車的人，希望所有客運公司能改善", "display_name": "中正代表 No.16,572", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-12T14:39:34+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 16313, "sprite_key": "elephant_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "其他", "content": "隨然我不是台北人，但是真心希望沈伯洋當任台北市長👍", "display_name": "大安代表 陳小潔", "mood": "positive", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-12T14:39:42+00:00", "duration_seconds": 18, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 49107, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "環境", "content": "現在的台北市根本就是一個臭城，尤其台北車站那裡根本跟東南亞一樣，沈委員請問你會如何解決臭水滿地的問題", "display_name": "中正代表 No.49,107", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 43446, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.43,446", "district": "neihu", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 16572, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "display_name": "中正代表 No.16,572", "district": "zhongzheng